The headers in this directory are for compiling on macOS 14.6 (Sonoma) and newer.
macOS releases include the ICU binary, but not ICU headers.

For other platforms, installed ICU headers should be used rather than these.
They are specific to the macOS platform.

The headers here are from ICU version 74.2 downloaded from the ICU project.
https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/releases/tag/release-74-2

Local modification: each header contains "#pragma clang system_header" right after its include guard, so that
these headers are treated like installed ICU headers (e.g. ICU's opaque types are not reported by the static analyzer).
Re-apply this when updating the headers.
